# Introduction

Welcome to the guide. Start with [installing](#installation), then read about the
[options](#options-1).

![Logo](img/logo.png)

### Conventions

Commands are shown as `mrq <command>`.

# Installation

## Requirements

A Rust toolchain; see the [conventions](#conventions).

## Options

Pass `--locked` to `cargo install`. The [usage options](#options-1) come later.

# Using mrq

## Usage

Read the [introduction](#introduction) and the [FAQ](notes/faq.md#questions) first.

### Options

Unlike the [install options](#options), these apply to every
command. See [above](#options-1).

### Shortcuts for [installing](#installation)

See the [project page](https://example.org/mrq).
